# Set Home Alt switches the altitudes shown between above home and above sea level.
#
# BUT_Homealt_Click sets cs.altoffsethome to minus the home altitude when it is zero and back to
# zero when it is not; cs.alt, which the HUD and the vehicle panel show, is `_alt - altoffsethome`.
# It sends nothing. `GCSViews/FlightData.cs:1236-1247, ExtLibs/ArduPilot/CurrentState.cs:325-328`
#
# Needs SITL, for a home altitude: tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/fly-homealt.gui -- tcp:127.0.0.1:5760

screen fly
window 1600x1200
settle 8

# The Actions grid is on the Actions page, tabActions; the strip opens on Quick, as
# tabControlactions.SelectedIndex = 0 has it. `GCSViews/FlightData.Designer.cs:595-611`
click fly-tab-actions
expect fly.tab tabActions

expect fly.home_alt off
click fly-homealt
expect fly.home_alt on
expect status ~ above sea level
click fly-homealt
expect fly.home_alt off
expect status ~ above home
